                    <p><strong>&#128204; TL;DR - Logistics &amp; Transport Accounting Services at a Glance</strong></p>
                    <p>Logistics accounting in Gurugram covers GTA GST (RCM 5% or forward charge 5%/12%, SAC 9965), e-way bill management (&gt;Rs 50K, 200% penalty), fleet depreciation and S44AE presumptive (&le;10 vehicles), multi-state warehouse GST 18%, and freight forwarder IGST. GST Commissionerate Gurugram + RTO Gurugram. Bilaspur corridor (Amazon, Delhivery, Flipkart), Manesar, Garhi Harsaru ICD, KMP Expressway. No Professional Tax. From Rs 10,000/month.</p>
                </div>
                <p>Gurugram is NCR's largest logistics hub &ndash; Bilaspur warehousing corridor, IMT Manesar, Garhi Harsaru ICD, KMP Expressway. Delhivery HQ. Amazon/Flipkart/Ecom Express fulfillment. Every dispatch needs GTA classification and e-way bill. Learn more about <a href="/travel-and-logistics-accounting-services">Logistics Accounting across India</a>.</p>
                <p>Patron's Golf Course Extension Road office provides GTA GST, e-way bill integration, fleet accounting, and multi-state compliance. For general accounting, see <a href="/accounting-services/gurugram">Accounting Services Gurugram</a>. For GST, see <a href="/gst-registration/gurugram">GST Registration Gurugram</a>.</p>
