                        <tr><td>GTA RCM vs Forward Charge</td><td>Annual decision: RCM (recipient 5%) vs forward (5% no ITC or 12% with ITC). Cannot switch mid-year. Wrong selection impacts cash flow for entire FY</td><td>Patron advises based on input cost analysis. 12% forward charge for high-input companies. Decision support before FY start</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>E-Way Bill Penalties</td><td>Missing/expired = vehicle detention + 200% tax under S129 CGST. Thousands of daily dispatches from Bilaspur/Manesar</td><td>Patron integrates e-way bill with accounting. Real-time validity tracking. Reconciliation against GSTR-1 for audit readiness</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>Multi-State GST Burden</td><td>Warehouses in Haryana + Rajasthan + UP = separate GSTINs. Monthly GSTR-1/3B each. Inter-state stock transfers with tax invoices</td><td>Patron manages all GSTINs with per-state deadline tracking. Inter-state documentation automated</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>Diesel Without ITC</td><td>40-50% of operating cost. No GST ITC on petroleum. State VAT unrecoverable. Directly impacts profitability</td><td>Patron tracks diesel separately with vehicle-wise cost per km. Fuel efficiency analysis for fleet optimization</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>S44AE to Regular Books</td><td>Transition when fleet exceeds 10 vehicles. Presumptive to regular accounting requires careful planning</td><td>Patron manages transition. Vehicle-wise depreciation at 15% WDV. Full books with fleet P&amp;L and S44AB audit prep</td></tr>

