        <div class="text-content">
            <h2 class="section-title">Legal &amp; Compliance Framework</h2>
            <div class="content-text">
                
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>GTA GST (SAC 9965):</strong> RCM: specified recipients pay 5%. Forward: 5% no ITC or 12% with ITC. Annual FY selection</li>
                    <li><strong>E-Way Bill (Rule 138):</strong> Mandatory &gt; Rs 50K. ewaybillgst.gov.in. 200 km/day. S129: 200% penalty</li>
                    <li><strong>Warehousing:</strong> 18% GST general. Exempt for agricultural produce and cold storage</li>
                    <li><strong>S44AE:</strong> Presumptive &le;10 vehicles. Rs 1,000/ton/month (heavy), Rs 7,500 (others). &gt;10: regular books</li>
                    <li><strong>TDS S194C:</strong> 1% individual/HUF, 2% others. Threshold Rs 30K single or Rs 1L aggregate</li>
                    <li><strong>No Professional Tax:</strong> Haryana advantage for driver/warehouse workforce</li>
                </ul>
                <p><strong>Authority Portal:</strong> <a href="https://ewaybillgst.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ewaybillgst.gov.in</a> (E-Way Bill Portal)</p>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

